      "robos:abilities": "Union Strike: Attack every adjacent hero with 3 dice. | Budget Freeze: Prevent heroes using potions for one round. | Bipartisan Gridlock: Roll combat die each turn. Black shield = lose turn; skull = +1 attack die. | Political Infighting: At ≤4 BP, roll a combat die at start of turn; on a white shield, heroes choose which available special attack it uses.",
