      "dcterms:description": "Brown + Husted · Ohio Hydra Boss — Union Strike: Attack every adjacent hero with 3 dice. Budget Freeze: Prevent heroes using potions for one round. Bipartisan Gridlock: Roll combat die each turn. Black shield = lose turn; skull = +1 attack die. Universal Hydra Rule — Political Infighting: At ≤4 BP, on a white shield at turn start, heroes choose its special attack.",
